{
  "info": {
    "name": "Paygate API",
    "description": "API Collection for Paygate (Internal Payment Gateway).\n\n### Getting Started\n1. **Environment**: Select 'Paygate API Environment'.\n2. **Authentication**:\n   - **Payments API** (`/api/v1/payments/*`): Requires `X-API-Key: {{api_key}}` (merchant key formatted as `pg_[code]_[entropy]`).\n   - **Admin API** (`/api/v1/admin/*`): Requires `X-API-Key: {{master_api_key}}` (default: `admin-paygate`).\n3. **Quick Setup**: Run 'Create Merchant (Localoka V2)' in the **Merchant Management** folder first to automatically issue and save a valid `api_key` to your Postman environment.\n4. **Audit & Deduplication**: Each request automatically generates `{{dynamic_request_id}}` and `{{dynamic_merchant_reff}}` via the collection pre-request script. Replay protection is handled via `X-Request-Id`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.variables.set('dynamic_request_id', 'req-' + pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));",
          "pm.variables.set('dynamic_merchant_reff', 'ref-' + Date.now() + '-' + Math.floor(Math.random() * 10000));"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Liveness Probe",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/health/live",
          "host": [
            "{{base_url}}"
          ],
          "path": [
            "health",
            "live"
          ]
        },
        "description": "Liveness probe endpoint to verify that the HTTP server process is alive."
      },
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Readiness Probe",
      "event": [
        {
